name: sim.getSystemTimeInMs
description:
luaSynopsis: int systemTimeOrTimeDiff=sim.getSystemTimeInMs(int previousTime)
pythonSynopsis: int systemTimeOrTimeDiff=sim.getSystemTimeInMs(int previousTime)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. previousTime: value that indicates how the command should operate:
2. >=0: the function returns a time difference with previousTime. PreviousTime must have been previously retrieved with the -1 argument below.
3. -1: the function returns a time relative to an arbitrary time. Use this to measure time differences within CoppeliaSim
4. -2: the function returns a time as follows:
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. a time in milliseconds as described here above.
